<%= intro %>

<% if ds_present? -%>
<%= step("Turn DNSSEC off") %>

<%= outage_warning %>

1. Open https://account.squarespace.com/domains and choose **<%= domain %>**.
2. Go to **DNS** -> **DNSSEC** and turn DNSSEC off. Change nothing else.
3. <%= confirm %>
4. <%= after_dnssec %>

<% end -%>
<%= step("Use Cloudflare's nameservers") %>

<%= ns_timing %>

1. Open https://account.squarespace.com/domains and choose **<%= domain %>**.
2. Go to **DNS** -> **Domain Nameservers** and choose **Use custom nameservers**.
3. Enter exactly these two, replacing any others:
<%= ns_list %>
4. <%= confirm %>
5. <%= done %>
